{"step_index":1090,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:10:40Z","input_tokens":2410,"cache_read_tokens":185179,"output_tokens":625,"thinking":"The \"전화번호\" field in Bizno is empty; the representative's name has been updated to 김대곤. It is necessary to investigate alternative resources. Specifically, the KDB Nextround platform (nextround.kr) lists `02-6959-1303` as the official contact number for the partner/accelerator desk. Additionally, WHOIS records for `linkbean.co.kr` or `linkbean.kr` will be checked, looking for the representative names: `이승주`, `김대곤`, or `윤주현`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst net = require('net');\\n\\nfunction queryWhois(domain) {\\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\\n    const socket = net.createConnection(43, 'whois.krnic.net', () => {\\n      socket.write(domain + '\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    });\\n    let data = '';\\n    socket.on('data', chunk => { data += chunk.toString('utf8'); });\\n    socket.on('end', () => resolve(data));\\n    socket.on('error', err => reject(err));\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nasync function test() {\\n  const domains = ['linkbean.co.kr', 'linkbean.kr', 'linkbean.io', 'haeyaknono.com', 'haeyaknono.co.kr', 'haeyaknono.kr'];\\n  for (const d of domains) {\\n    if (d.endsWith('.kr') || d.endsWith('.co.kr')) {\\n      const res = await queryWhois(d);\\n      const reg = res.match(/등록인\\\\s*:\\\\s*([^\\\\r\\\\n]+)/);\\n      const phone = res.match(/책임자 전화번호\\\\s*:\\\\s*([^\\\\r\\\\n]+)/);\\n      console.log(d + ' ->', reg ? reg[1] : 'NONE', phone ? phone[1] : 'NONE');\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\ntest();\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\find_company_phone_numbers\"","IsDaemon":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Querying whois for linkbean and haeyaknono\"","toolSummary":"\"Query whois for linkbean domains\""}}]}
